      "writtenOn": "2021-09-22T20:11:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Amstan, what do you think about making kukui boards use i2c_bitbang before tasks start? Some chips don\u0027t support polling mode. So, they need i2c bitbang and I\u0027m interested in unifying the pre-task transactions. Thanks,",
