      "writtenOn": "2021-09-28T23:03:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like Keyboard needs to initialized before task init for recovery mode mechanism, more discussion is available here CL:3138215\n\nCan we add CONFIG_I2C_BITBANG_WHEN_TASK_UNINIT config as in rev2 of this CL so that we don\u0027t break other boards?\n\nWe have follow on CLs CL:3183329 , CL:3183330 where we would need to enable IOEX \u0026 board ID reading pre-task for WIP CLs: CL:3173100 , CL:3038423",
      "parentUuid": "10d3c890_b16acff4",
      "revId": "a9a48642c19d86d04aec66ff9577e9ae09361d87",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
